<title>USA: Russia won't target Japan with missiles-Japan aide.</title>
<headline>Russia won't target Japan with missiles-Japan aide.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia has promised not to target its missiles against Japan and the two countries have agreed to hold regular summit meetings, a Japanese official said on Friday.</p>
<p>The official, speaking after a breakfast meeting between Russian President Boris Yeltsin and Japanese Prime Minister Ryutaro Hashimoto, also said Moscow and Tokyo had agreed a new initiative to expand investment.</p>
</text>
